[9.33,"o","unstale reads new release notes with a model, on your own key or your Codex plan.\r\n"]
[9.39,"o","None is set up here (Codex is not logged in).\r\n"]
[9.45,"o","\r\n"]
[9.51,"o","  1  Set one up   shows the one line to add\r\n"]
[9.57,"o","  2  Not now      free · advisories and deprecations only, ≈ 27% of the changes in new releases\r\n"]
[9.63,"o","\r\n"]
[9.69,"o","Enter for 1, or 2:\r\n"]
[9.75,"o","\r\n"]
[9.81,"o","Add one of these lines to your shell profile or this repo's .env, then run `unstale setup`:\r\n"]
[9.87,"o","\r\n"]
[9.93,"o","  OPENAI_API_KEY=<key>      OpenAI\r\n"]
[9.99,"o","  AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=<key>  Vercel AI Gateway\r\n"]
